# Allowlist the API image context. Local data, credentials, Git history and
# operator notes must never be sent to the build daemon.
**
!Dockerfile
!requirements.txt
!src/
src/**
!src/*.py
src/*/**
!README.md
!HOW_TO_CALL.md
!LICENSE
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.log
**/.env*
**/.secrets/
# Explicit defense in depth for workstation-only notes and invitation drafts.
**/.local/
